<title>BAHRAIN: NBB signs $520 mln loan with Bahrain.</title>
<headline>NBB signs $520 mln loan with Bahrain.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Bank of Bahrain (NBB) said on Wednesday it signed a $520 million syndicated loan agreement with Bahrain for a power and water plant.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the signing of the term sheet &quot;confirms the structure and main terms and conditions of the $520 million loan facility&quot;.</p>
</text>
